"""
Pinterest OAuth 2.0 & Sandbox Integration Demo Server
=====================================================
App ID: 1600990 | Black Panther Store (blackpantherstore.co.za)

This server demonstrates the complete Pinterest OAuth 2.0 flow and API integration
for developer access approval by Pinterest review team:
  1. OAuth 2.0 Authorization flow (Login -> Consent -> Callback with code)
  2. Token Exchange (Basic Auth code -> Access Token)
  3. API Integration: Fetch User Profile (GET /v5/user_account)
  4. API Integration: Fetch or Auto-Create Board (GET/POST /v5/boards)
  5. API Integration: Create Live Test Pin (POST /v5/pins)
  6. Direct Link to view created Pin on Pinterest website
"""

